<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak FinMin sets 9-month T-bill auction for Wed.</title>
<headline>Slovak FinMin sets 9-month T-bill auction for Wed.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovak Finance Ministry will auction an unspecified tranche of nine-month T-bills on Wednesday, the National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) said on Monday.</p>
<p>In the ministry's last auction of similar T-bills on October 30, the first with such a maturity this year, the average yield hit 9.307 percent.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
</text>
